{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny man, no bigger than a cat, on a quest to rescue your beloved from the depths of hell.  Demons invaded your world and took her away.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chef (knives, axes, pots), Thief (daggers + critical hits), and more \u2014 each with unique traits and weapon preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.apng?t=1756400841\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=152 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming and crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft hearty meals and powerful weapons, then defeat enemies in turn-based battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" width=780 height=157 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.webm?t=1756400841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique \u2014 spikes, loot chests, deadly bats, elusive witches\u2026 and many surprises.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/cedb844add4f7f85438c067fe7356023.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/cedb844add4f7f85438c067fe7356023.webm?t=1756400841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> - be the first to know about the start of the closed playtest!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912900?t=1756400841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912900?t=1756400841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/72be11b302478d4ce47929c34c9919587833f236/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756400841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/72be11b302478d4ce47929c34c9919587833f236/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756400841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny man, no bigger than a cat, on a quest to rescue your beloved from the depths of hell.  Demons invaded your world and took her away.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your class</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chef (knives, axes, pots), Thief (daggers + critical hits), and more \u2014 each with unique traits and weapon preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/36f40f39b9cd826660aff9adc5f1ff41.apng?t=1756400841\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1020 height=152 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming and crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft hearty meals and powerful weapons, then defeat enemies in turn-based battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" width=780 height=157 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/2a758b2c224f075df8ad15d7b186aef1.webm?t=1756400841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique \u2014 spikes, loot chests, deadly bats, elusive witches\u2026 and many surprises.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/cedb844add4f7f85438c067fe7356023.poster.avif?t=1756400841\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/extras/cedb844add4f7f85438c067fe7356023.webm?t=1756400841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> - be the first to know about the start of the closed playtest!</p>","developers":["WW Byte"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912900/2b5bf6c29451bc965bbdd259f1bda4e6297746c7/header.jpg?t=1756400841","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_